WEBVTT

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:01.001
Because it's bad enough
not getting what you want,

00:14:01.025 --> 00:14:04.112
but it's even worse to have
an idea of what it is you want,

00:14:04.136 --> 00:14:06.176
and find out, at the end of the journey,

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:09.364
that it isn't, in fact,
what you wanted all along.

00:14:09.388 --> 00:14:10.976
So, I'm going to end it there.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:15.976
But what I really want to stress is:
by all means, success, yes.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.572
But let's accept the strangeness
of some of our ideas.

00:14:18.596 --> 00:14:21.341
Let's probe away
at our notions of success.

00:14:21.365 --> 00:14:24.976
Let's make sure our ideas of success
are truly our own.

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:26.976
Thank you very much.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:33.284
(Applause)